# Build context for images/sandbox/Dockerfile: the four packages it compiles (sources and
# package.json, never node_modules or dist), images/sandbox and the user guide the `docs` tool of
# the sessionboxer MCP reads (ADR-0062). Everything else stays out so the context is a few dozen kB
# and a change there cannot touch any layer.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.github
.local
.env*
apps
build
docs/*
!docs/GUIDE.md
scripts
spike-output
*.md
